  "label": "Donald Trump is mapped as the proponent of the 'a muslim ban' policy",
  "description": "The visual entity 'Donald_Trump' is mapped onto the textual entity 'a muslim ban' through the meme's overall intent. The image of Donald Trump pointing outward, combined with the text 'a muslim ban would've stopped that', creates an analogical mapping where Trump is implicitly identified as the person who proposed or supports the Muslim ban policy. This mapping is reinforced by the accusatory gesture and the context of the meme, which associates him with the policy and its implied justification.",
